SubFlow
=======

SubFlow is an independent, self-hosted subscription management platform. It is
a modified derivative of the Sub-Store project and is distributed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).

Upstream projects
-----------------

Sub-Store
  Upstream: https://github.com/sub-store-org/Sub-Store
  Authors:  Peng-YM and the Sub-Store contributors
  License:  AGPL-3.0 (backend), GPL-3.0 (frontend)

  The Go backend in this repository is an independent reimplementation of the
  Sub-Store backend HTTP contract, written from the public Sub-Store source
  code and API behaviour. The frontend under `web/` is a modified copy of the
  Sub-Store frontend (baseline v2.34.1).

Modifications of the upstream frontend
--------------------------------------

  See `web/README.md` for the exact list. In short: rebranding to SubFlow,
  original SubFlow artwork replacing the upstream icon, same-origin API
  configuration, and additional interface localization.

